'''Zackie Peng''' (ジャッキー・ペンZ ''Jakkī Pen Z'', '''Jackie Pen Z''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Jackie Peng]] that appears in [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Zackie Peng
|image = E 288.png
