==Enemy==
He has high DPS with short range, and, like most other Zombie enemies, can burrow and revive once. However, Zackie Peng's attacks are single-target, making him useless if he burrows into an area with a lot of meatshields.

==Strategy==
Zackie Peng is fairly insignificant in comparison to other Zombies. Meatshielding is important, especially since this can bait him into burrowing quickly. After he has burrowed, a decently strong [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] should be able to eliminate him easily.

