==Trivia==
*Since [[Jackie Peng]] loves kung-fu movies, Zackie Peng's design may be a reference to a [https://youtu.be/941z56i7QJE scene] from ''[[wikipedia:Kung Pow! Enter the Fist|Kung Pow! Enter the Fist]]'' in which The Chosen One punches a hole through an enemy's stomach.
*His description is missing the apostrophe in "that's".
*His base attack power is higher than [[Big Peng Z]]'s, though this is offset by Big Peng Z's [[Toxic]] attacks.
*Unlike Jackie Peng, Zackie Peng jumps facing more towards the front when attacking, whereas Jackie Peng jumps facing sideways when attacking.

